menu "RoboHub device node runtime"

config RH_DEVICE_NODE
    bool "Device node runtime"
    select RH_CORE
    select RH_TRANSPORT
    select RH_TELEMETRY
    default n
    help
      The runtime a device node is built on: the link, the telemetry bridge,
      publishing a reading and dispatching a control request to the device it
      names.

endmenu
